<!--
橫向情報看板版型（非email，供內部網頁/連結檢視用）。
設計語彙呼應工程製圖：淺藍灰底的「藍圖紙」淡網格 + 銅色線路點綴，
對應台達電子業本業，而非制式的AI簡報風格。
單一淺色主題，不做深色模式切換（同一份設計語言的延伸選擇）。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ issue_title }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #eef1f4;
    --panel-solid: #ffffff;
    --panel-border: #dde3e8;
    --copper: #a8632f;
    --copper-dim: #c98a54;
    --text-primary: #1c2b38;
    --text-secondary: #57707f;
    --text-tertiary: #8298a6;
    --rule: #e2e8ec;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--rule) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rule) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 28px 28px;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "PingFang TC", "Noto Sans TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .mono {
    font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Mono", "Roboto Mono", monospace;
  }

  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--copper); outline-offset: 2px; }

  /* Masthead */
  .masthead {
    padding: 28px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    background: var(--panel-solid);
  }
  .masthead-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--copper);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .masthead h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-wrap: balance;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .masthead-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 18px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .masthead-intro {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    max-width: 70ch;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  /* Board */
  .board-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: hidden;
    padding: 20px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 40px;
    scroll-snap-type: x proximity;
  }
  .board {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    width: max-content;
  }
  .column {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    width: 300px;
    flex: none;
    background: var(--panel-solid);
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 220px);
    min-height: 320px;
  }
  .column.is-general {
    border-color: var(--copper-dim);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(201,130,79,0.15);
  }
  .column-header {
    padding: 14px 16px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: var(--panel-solid);
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .column-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .column-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .column-count {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--copper);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .column-body {
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }

  .entry {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 22px 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .entry:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .entry-index {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .entry-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .entry-title:hover { color: var(--copper); }
  .entry-summary {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .entry-relevance {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--copper);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .board-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .column-body::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 8px; width: 8px; }
  .board-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  .column-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--panel-border); border-radius: 4px; }
  .board-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  .column-body::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }

  .footer {
    padding: 20px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    max-width: 80ch;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .board-scroll { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="masthead">
  <p class="masthead-eyebrow mono">Delta AI Intelligence Briefing</p>
  <h1>{{ issue_title }}</h1>
  <div class="masthead-meta mono">
    <span>{{ issue_date }}</span>
    <span>{{ columns | length }} 個追蹤領域</span>
    <span>共 {{ columns | map(attribute='entries') | map('length') | sum }} 則情報</span>
  </div>
  {% if intro %}
  <p class="masthead-intro">{{ intro }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</header>

<div class="board-scroll">
  <div class="board">
    {% for column in columns %}
    <section class="column{{ ' is-general' if column.is_general else '' }}">
      <div class="column-header">
        <p class="column-eyebrow mono">{{ column.eyebrow }}</p>
        <h2 class="column-title">{{ column.name }}</h2>
        <p class="column-count mono">{{ column.entries | length }} 則</p>
      </div>
      <div class="column-body">
        {% for item in column.entries %}
        <article class="entry">
          <span class="entry-index mono">{{ '%02d' | format(loop.index) }}</span>
          <div>
            <a class="entry-title" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.title }}</a>
            <p class="entry-summary">{{ item.summary }}</p>
            {% if item.relevance %}
            <p class="entry-relevance">→ {{ item.relevance }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<p class="footer">
  本簡報由 AI 輔助彙整公開資料來源（產業新聞、學術論文、技術社群討論）並附原始連結，僅供內部參考，未經進一步事實查核前請勿對外引用。
  各欄位依領域彙整，條列順序不代表絕對排名。如需調整追蹤領域或來源，請聯繫電子報維運同仁。
</p>

</body>
</html>
